tncd (1.97~beta) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Go port (tncd 2.0 beta line): the daemon is now a single static Go binary
    with no python3 runtime dependency
  * Packaging moves from fpm/Python to nfpm/Go cross-compilation
    (debian/rules now builds with `go build`)

 -- KU0HN <ku0hn@ku0hn.radio>  Thu, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

tncd (1.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Parallel Bluetooth port startup — AGWPE server now starts immediately
    regardless of how many ports are still connecting
  * Fix SIGABRT crash: replaced blocking dbus ConnectProfile thread with
    async GLib.idle_add call, eliminating cross-thread libdbus heap corruption
  * Fix UnknownObject on props.Get for devices not yet visible to BlueZ
  * Fix br-connection-busy noise: InProgress silently ignored in error handler

 -- KU0HN <ku0hn@ku0hn.radio>  Sun, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

tncd (1.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

